<title>USA: Biogen names Tobin CEO.</title>
<headline>Biogen names Tobin CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biogen Inc said Friday it has named James Tobin president and chief executive, succeeding James Vincent, who will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>Most recently, Tobin was president and chief operating officer of Biogen, a biopharmaceutical company.</p>
